<div class="page">
  <div class="phead"><div class="wrap"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <span aria-current="page">Contact</span></nav><h1 class="h-display">We'd love to <span class="it" style="color:var(--saffron)">hear from you</span></h1></div></div>
  <section style="padding-top:30px"><div class="wrap two">
    <div>
      <p class="lead">Questions about an order, a product, or how to use our powders? Send us a note — we reply within one business day.</p>
      <div class="info-list">
        <div><span class="ic"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m3 7 9 6 9-6"/></svg></span><div><b>Email</b><a href="mailto:hello@vedaapothecaryusa.com">hello@vedaapothecaryusa.com</a></div></div>
        <div><span class="ic"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 4h4l2 5-2.5 1.5a11 11 0 0 0 5 5L15 13l5 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A16 16 0 0 1 3 6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"/></svg></span><div><b>Questions, complaints &amp; adverse events</b><a href="tel:+17137706032">Call +1 (713) 770-6032</a></div></div>
        <div><span class="ic"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.5-7-12a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 5.5-7 12-7 12z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2.5"/></svg></span><div><b>US office</b><span>Old Soul Goods Inc., 1325 Main Street Unit No. 1404, Katy, TX 77494</span></div></div>
        <div><span class="ic"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg></span><div><b>Hours</b><span>Mon–Fri, 9am–6pm CT</span></div></div>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:24px">Looking for quick answers? Read the <a href="/pages/faq" style="text-decoration:underline">FAQ</a> or see <a href="/policies/shipping-policy" style="text-decoration:underline">Shipping &amp; Returns</a>.</p>
    </div>
    {% form 'contact', class: 'card', id: 'contact-form' %}<input type="hidden" name="contact[form]" value="contact">{% if form.posted_successfully? %}<div class="empty"><div class="success" style="padding:0"><div class="tick"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4.5 4.5L19 7"/></svg></div></div><h2 class="h-display" style="font-size:32px">Message received</h2><p class="lead" style="margin:10px auto 0">Thank you — our team will get back to you shortly.</p></div>{% else %}{% if form.errors %}<p class="form-note">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</p>{% endif %}
      <div class="fgrid2">
        <div class="field"><input id="n1" name="contact[name]" placeholder=" " required autocomplete="name"><label for="n1">Full name</label></div>
        <div class="field"><input id="n2" name="contact[email]" type="email" placeholder=" " required autocomplete="email"><label for="n2">Email</label></div>
        <div class="field full"><select id="n5" name="contact[topic]"><option>Order question</option><option>Product question</option><option>Subscription</option><option>Returns</option><option>Other</option></select><label for="n5">Topic</label></div>
        <div class="field full"><textarea id="n6" name="contact[body]" placeholder=" " required></textarea><label for="n6">Your message</label></div>
      </div>
      <button class="btn block" type="submit" style="margin-top:16px">Send message</button>
      <p class="form-note" data-form-note aria-live="polite"></p>
    {% endif %}{% endform %}
  </div></section>
  <section class="page-faq" id="faq" style="padding-top:30px"><div class="wrap narrow"><div class="sec-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Questions</span><h2 class="h-sec">Contact <span class="it">FAQ</span></h2></div></div><div class="acc"><details open><summary>How quickly will you reply to my message?</summary><div class="in">We reply to messages sent through this page or by email within one business day.</div></details><details><summary>How do I report a complaint or an adverse event?</summary><div class="in">Call +1 (713) 770-6032 or email hello@vedaapothecaryusa.com. Please include the product name and the batch number printed on the pouch if you have it.</div></details><details><summary>What should I include when asking about an order?</summary><div class="in">Your order number and the email address used at checkout. If an item arrived damaged or incorrect, add a photo so we can resolve it quickly.</div></details><details><summary>Can I ask product or usage questions here?</summary><div class="in">Yes. Choose “Product question” in the Topic menu. For general guidance on using the powders, you can also browse the FAQ and the blog.</div></details><details><summary>Where is Veda Apothecary based?</summary><div class="in">Our U.S. office is in Katy, Texas, where Old Soul Goods Inc. distributes and ships every order.</div></details></div></div></section>
  </div>
